    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like people use that \"healing is a journey\" stuff just to keep you running on a treadmill that never ends. but what if there's nothing left to heal? what if some people are just fundamentally flawed from the start? like, what if some damage is just too deep to ever truly overcome?",
